Z||000000||Primaris||08-10-2001||11:35 PM||||Hi all.  I'm new to this forum but not to fieros.  I'm about to change the lower ball joints on my '88 GT and am wondering if there is anything special I need to know?  What is a good price to pay?  I've been quoted about $39 ea. from Adv. Auto.<P>------------------<BR>Signatures are a waste of bandwidth!||||reg||1
Z||000001||DRH||08-11-2001||12:03 AM||||I paid $59 each at <A HREF="http://www.fierostore.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fierostore.com</A>  about 6 months ago so it sounds good to me! I had trouble finding them anywhere else. 88 parts seem to be getting easier to find here lately.<P>Small world... I used to live in Clarksville.<P>Welcome!||||reg||1
